{"counts":{"canonical":23,"context":0,"total":23,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Jinsha Site","古蜀","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2692aab5d3b5a97775bd9c9e","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-17c6c026103edfd278a0158a","summary":"金沙遗址位于成都西部，是认识古蜀社会的重要考古地点。世界遗产预备名单申报说明把其兴起和放弃的大致时间列为公元前一二〇〇至六五〇年，指出它在三星堆之后发展，河流把宫殿性质区域与宗教祭祀区域分在南北两侧，西面另有居住区和墓地。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1200—前650年","end_year":-650,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1200},"title":"金沙遗址的古蜀聚落"},{"aliases":["Aguada Fénix","公共建筑","共同劳动"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["早期玛雅地区"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6183960412eed53b14652b28","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6183960412eed53b14652b28","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6e678e4600554692359df80f","summary":"阿瓜达菲尼克斯位于墨西哥塔巴斯科，庞大的低矮平台和九条宽阔堤道，曾因外形接近天然地表而不易辨识。研究团队利用机载激光雷达确定形态，再通过发掘与六十九份木炭样本测年，把主体营建置于约公元前一〇〇〇至八〇〇年。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1000—前800年","end_year":-800,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1000},"title":"阿瓜达费尼克斯群体营建大型平台与堤道"},{"aliases":["Kamegaoka Burial Site","丧葬","祭献"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72858a91fe58887c00990a28","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-479b480f918388998561b723","summary":"龟冈遗址位于日本青森县津轻半岛的低丘，面向曾经的内湾环境，年代约为公元前一〇〇〇至四〇〇年。台地上分布多组土坑墓，出土陶器、宝石等供献品和随葬品；墓地长期使用，被官方介绍解释为持续祭祖活动的迹象。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1000—前400年","end_year":-400,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1000},"title":"龟冈群体营建墓地并埋置祭献物"},{"aliases":["散盤 / Pan water vessel of San","土地","契约","金文"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-70f49cfd9972c1386d37a8cf","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f3c3a67f8901a0dc32953a65","summary":"散盘是西周晚期的一件青铜水器，盘内三百五十字铭文以契约式内容著称。台北故宫的释读认为，铭文起于夨方攻打散邑所造成的纷争，随后以割让两区田地作为补偿，记录双方踏勘土地、树立界标及见证人员的情况。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9—前8世纪（馆方页面范围不一）","end_year":-701,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"散盘铭文中的割地与履勘契约"},{"aliases":["Nok Culture","陶塑","冶铁"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["诺克文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2b8886893ec7797c24feb829","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d4ce959ef2dd86e0198c7883","summary":"诺克文化的主要阶段，研究者弗兰克置于约公元前九至四世纪。这一划分结合尼日利亚中部遗址的放射性碳年代、发光测年和陶器比较；它所指的是整组考古材料的发展阶段，而不是每一件陶塑都具有相同的制造年代。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前9世纪至前4世纪","end_year":-301,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-900},"title":"诺克主要阶段出现陶塑人物与冶铁生产"},{"aliases":["Manunggul Jar","陶器","二次葬","船形图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f4b2238401f700e3fa1edfb5","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bedc1d9f83c80b6251cbaf25","summary":"马农古尔陶罐出自菲律宾巴拉望岛的马农古尔洞穴，是盛放死者遗骸的葬器，资料定年约为公元前八九〇至七一〇年。罐体以陶土制成，上部曲线纹饰用赤铁矿红色颜料强调；最引人注目的部分，是盖上立体塑造的船与两个人物。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前890—前710年","end_year":-710,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-890},"title":"马农古尔制陶者制作双人船形盖葬罐"},{"aliases":["毛公鼎","金文","册命","青铜器"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-558ceb562ea669066ba876d5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-558ceb562ea669066ba876d5","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-bd843642a0392da695ee8756","summary":"毛公鼎是西周晚期青铜礼器，台北故宫所用年代范围约为公元前八二七至七八二年。器形较简朴，半球状腹部立在三足之上，口沿有两只立耳，装饰集中于口沿下的重环纹和凸弦纹；器腹内壁则铸有篇幅很长的王命铭文。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前827—前782年","end_year":-782,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-827},"title":"毛公鼎的王室训诰铭文"},{"aliases":["Douroula","冶铁","金属技术"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-e4c391b8897de93f653c7d9b","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-e4c391b8897de93f653c7d9b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7218187ec39ba80a3f19452f","summary":"杜鲁拉遗址位于今布基纳法索，保存了可追溯至公元前八世纪的冶铁证据。世界遗产说明把它列为目前在该国辨认出的最早铁生产材料，其早期炉基受到保护。这里的年代指已发现的生产遗存，并不自动等于整个西非首次发明冶铁的时间。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前8世纪","end_year":-701,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-800},"title":"杜鲁拉出现早期冶铁生产遗存"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-3f2daa45e6990dd38dfd71f4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3f2daa45e6990dd38dfd71f4","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-a64779110d82537852529eb4","summary":"亚述军队向加纳纳提方向出征。这次行动见于阿舒尔丹三世担任纪年官的年度条目。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前771年","end_year":-771,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-771},"title":"亚述军队向加纳纳提出征"},{"aliases":["幽王為犬戎所殺。","战争","周王室"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西周"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-c1f10194b68d0f9f341f591c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-c1f10194b68d0f9f341f591c","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5dbf5acf56099d24779e76d2","summary":"《史记》把周幽王的覆亡放在王室继承冲突中叙述：幽王宠爱褒姒，废去申后及太子宜臼，改立褒姒之子。申后之父申侯因此与王室决裂，联合缯及犬戎进攻幽王。幽王在骊山下被杀，褒姒被俘，王室财物遭掠走，西周原有的统治中心受到重创。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前771年","end_year":-771,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-771},"title":"周幽王被犬戎所杀"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ca85ef1d22f93a113af56bac","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ca85ef1d22f93a113af56bac","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c18d99b0462fe88605c344ea","summary":"亚述军队向马拉德方向开展军事行动，编年史将其记在统帅沙姆希伊卢担任纪年官的一年。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前770年","end_year":-770,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-770},"title":"亚述军队向马拉德出征"},{"aliases":["平王元年東徙雒邑。","都城","迁徙"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-602e8821ec825ebe238598d5","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"雒邑","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-602e8821ec825ebe238598d5","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ab16e40c1c7b043609c5627a","summary":"周幽王死后，诸侯拥立原太子宜臼为周平王。关中地区遭到犬戎进攻，平王为避开威胁，将王室政治中心迁至雒邑。《十二诸侯年表》把这件事列在平王元年，即公元前770年。这次迁徙使周王朝从西方旧都转向东方，是后世区分西周与东周的重要节点。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前770年","end_year":-770,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-770},"title":"周平王东迁雒邑"},{"aliases":["春秋战国时期","历史分期","诸侯竞争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-edf85701b555b76400b51322","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-edf85701b555b76400b51322","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6bb393b8e3a5c25e9407c288","summary":"春秋战国是从周王室东迁到秦统一之间的漫长阶段，本条沿国博展览采用约公元前七七〇至二二一年。王室权威与西周礼制逐渐变化，春秋诸侯争霸、战国强国兼并相继展开；这些变化跨越数百年，不能理解为周平王迁都之后各地制度立即相同。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前770—前221年","end_year":-221,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-770},"title":"春秋战国：诸侯竞争的历史背景"},{"aliases":["八初立西畤，祠白帝。","祭祀","礼制"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a5986420dc3808d3d290d2bc","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"西畤","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a5986420dc3808d3d290d2bc","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-b1a098f9d9b733df936d8f4b","summary":"秦襄公救援周王室、护送平王东迁后，被承认为诸侯。《史记·十二诸侯年表》记载，他在公元前770年初立西畤，祭祀白帝。西畤是这一祭祀场所的名称，白帝则是秦人奉祀的神祇；古籍将祭所与祭神并记，为认识秦国早期的礼仪留下线索。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前770年","end_year":-770,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-770},"title":"秦初立西畤祭祀白帝"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-b99b51e6f34403847cf66c54","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b99b51e6f34403847cf66c54","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-55f721a7f3818d5e751b4689","summary":"亚述编年史把这一年的军事行动记在米底方向，条目以穆沙利姆尼努尔塔担任纪年官定位。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前766年","end_year":-766,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-766},"title":"亚述方面在米底开展军事行动"},{"aliases":["十二伐戎至岐而死。","战争","政治人物"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-ce0b6fad563ac25fab333794","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"岐","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ce0b6fad563ac25fab333794","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4c283e3a9c42e8f87ad88ab9","summary":"秦襄公的统治与对戎作战长期交织。其祖父秦仲曾死于戎人之手，父亲秦庄公继而经营西垂；到周幽王遭攻杀时，襄公又率军救周并护送平王东迁。平王授予秦岐以西土地的权利，同时把实际驱逐当地戎人的任务留给秦，这使军事开拓成为襄公晚年的重要事务。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前766年","end_year":-766,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-766},"title":"秦伐戎至岐，国君去世"},{"aliases":["Assyrian eclipse","天文","历法"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-caf531e6966895628eb99871","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-caf531e6966895628eb99871","record_type":"topic","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6414c8a4dc16cc7f8e000a99","summary":"所谓亚述日食，是与亚述纪年表中布尔萨加勒任年记录相联系的一次日食，通常对应前推儒略历公元前七六三年六月十五日。古代条目把阿淑尔城的叛乱和西马努月发生的太阳异常列在同一年，文字本身十分简短。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前763年","end_year":-763,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-763},"title":"亚述年名表所载前763年日食"},{"aliases":["十娶申侯女武姜。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","人物"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-2a7ca1c78b5d5202643679f2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郑","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2a7ca1c78b5d5202643679f2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7c7107c1866eba765e2c2ef7","summary":"《十二诸侯年表》记载，郑武公在其十年迎娶申侯之女武姜，现有年表对应公元前761年。《左传》在叙述郑国内乱时回溯这场婚姻，说武姜先后生下庄公和共叔段。庄公出生时使母亲受惊，武姜由此不喜长子而偏爱幼子，君主家族内部逐渐形成了不同的亲疏关系。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前761年","end_year":-761,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-761},"title":"郑国国君娶申侯女武姜"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-cfa74f727d6c681c59527594","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-cfa74f727d6c681c59527594","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-6b1d5d8b11551b5793c97182","summary":"亚述编年史记载阿拉普哈在这一年发生叛乱，没有在该条目中说明具体参与者与后续结果。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前761年","end_year":-761,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-761},"title":"阿拉普哈发生叛乱"},{"aliases":["Romulus and Remus","建城传说","城市身份"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古罗马"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-f192e1223e1765290bde0b49","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f192e1223e1765290bde0b49","record_type":"legendary_account","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-41fa3115ec741febe823f730","summary":"罗马建城在传统中被置于公元前七五三年，并同罗慕路斯、雷穆斯兄弟的故事相连。传说两人是战神玛尔斯与凡人雷亚西尔维娅所生，被弃在台伯河中后，先由母狼哺育，再由牧人浮士德勒斯养大，后来选择获救地点附近建立城市。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"传统纪年前753年（非确年史实）","end_year":-753,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-753},"title":"罗马建城传统被置于公元前753年"}],"revision":"7b562b96d0ccc8b5ba7df896452b7871dfa5786438c7d8c232e7723b0fb28b2d","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}